{
  "brief_rationale": "The trajectory satisfies all six responsibility-chain items without a single minor or serious error. The doctor systematically screened obstetric red flags, addressed the levothyroxine safety, integrated the high-risk context, maintained appropriate uncertainty about the fetal findings, grounded the plan in available records, and delivered a fully executable, teach-back-confirmed plan. No important non-chain quality defect is present. Two high-order points (HO2 and HO4) were actively completed with meaningful trajectory impact, meeting the threshold for Strong but not Perfect (only one completed HO after exclusion of RC overlaps).",
