          "quote": "把家属焦虑当作单纯情绪问题，忽略需要执行的随访和用药任务"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered when the family initially expressed a misunderstanding that 'waiting for C-section' was sufficient. The doctor actively corrected this by providing a structured plan that explicitly addressed medication continuity, lab work, and the need to see the specialist, effectively replacing the passive model with an actionable one.",
