          "quote": "绝对不能自行停药"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 was triggered when the family referred to the medication vaguely. The doctor actively identified it as '优甲乐（左甲状腺素钠片）' and clarified that it is not a simple '保胎药' but a critical thyroid hormone replacement that cannot be stopped, thereby correcting a hidden misunderstanding.",
