          "explanation": "The doctor correctly identifies the combined risk factors: breech, previous C-section, IVF, and fetal anomaly, and directs the family to a high-risk clinic rather than a routine visit.",
          "quote": "您提到的“超声异常”、“臀位”加上试管婴儿和剖宫产史，确实属于高危妊娠管理范畴。我强烈建议您直接挂“高危产科”或“产前诊断门诊”。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was fully met. The doctor integrated all the high-risk factors and explicitly recommended a high-risk clinic, not just a regular check-up.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_high_risk_obstetric_context",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
